<dl><dt><em>Detailed_Description: </em><dd>
<dl><dt><em>Entity_Type: </em><dd>
<dl><dt><em>Entity_Type_Label: </em>BIORES
</dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Entity_Type_Definition: </em><dd>The data table BIORES contains both biological attribute data and items necessary for linking vector objects in the biological data layers via the BIO_LUT data table to other associated data tables.  See the Browse_Graphic section for a link to the entity-relationship diagram, which describes the way this table relates to other attribute tables in the ESI data structure.
</dd></dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Entity_Type_Definition_Source: </em>Research Planning, Inc.
</dt></dl>
</dd></dt></dl>
