</dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Attribute_Definition: </em><dd>An identifier that links records in the BIORES data table to records in the BIO_LUT data table or the flat format BIOFILE data table.
</dd></dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Attribute_Definition_Source: </em>NOAA
</dt></dl>
