<dl><dt><em>Attribute: </em><dd>
<dl><dt><em>Attribute_Label: </em>CONC
</dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Attribute_Definition: </em><dd>The field CONC refers to "concentration," abundance, or density values of a species at a particular location. No concentration data were available for fish, so the CONC field is populated with "-".
</dd></dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Attribute_Definition_Source: </em>Research Planning, Inc.
</dt></dl>
