</dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Attribute_Definition: </em><dd>Life history stage or activity type, where: if ELEMENT is "BIRD" then BREED2 = migrating; if ELEMENT is "FISH" then BREED2 = eggs; if ELEMENT is "INVERT" then BREED2 = eggs; if ELEMENT is "REPTILE" then BREED2 = hatching; if ELEMENT is "M_MAMMAL" then BREED2 = calving.  This attribute is not used for HABITAT or T_MAMMAL elements.
</dd></dt></dl>
