<dl><dt><em>Detailed_Description: </em><dd>
<dl><dt><em>Entity_Type: </em><dd>
<dl><dt><em>Entity_Type_Label: </em>SOURCES
</dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Entity_Type_Definition: </em><dd>The data table SOURCES contains the primary sources used to create the ESI data set.  See the Browse_Graphic section for a link to the entity-relationship diagram, which describes the way this table relates to other attribute tables in the ESI data structure.
</dd></dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Entity_Type_Definition_Source: </em>Research Planning, Inc.
</dt></dl>
</dd></dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Attribute: </em><dd>
<dl><dt><em>Attribute_Label: </em>SOURCE_ID
</dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Attribute_Definition: </em><dd>Source identifier that links records in the SOURCES data table to the items G_SOURCE and A_SOURCE in the SOC_DAT table; G_SOURCE and S_SOURCE in the BIORES table; and SOURCE_ID in the ESI and HYDRO data layers.
</dd></dt></dl>
<dl><dt><em>Attribute_Definition_Source: </em>Research Planning, Inc.
</dt></dl>
